WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.398
Your UI change just passed code review.

2
00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:06.117
But did anyone hover it?

3
00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:07.505
Meet UX Quality Check.

4
00:00:07.505 --> 00:00:10.470
It reads the diff, then measures the live page.

5
00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:13.469
Rows that touch on hover?

6
00:00:13.469 --> 00:00:14.690
Zero pixels apart.

7
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.165
Caught.

8
00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:18.874
A menu that shoves the page down?

9
00:00:18.874 --> 00:00:19.300
Caught.

10
00:00:21.003 --> 00:00:22.911
A Save button that writes twice?

11
00:00:22.911 --> 00:00:23.328
Caught.

12
00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:27.489
A toggle that runs away from your cursor?

13
00:00:27.489 --> 00:00:27.909
Caught.

14
00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:28.508
And fixed.

15
00:00:32.097 --> 00:00:35.126
Fifty two rules, mined from real review feedback.

16
00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:37.491
UX Quality Check.

17
00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:39.955
Just ask your agent to check the UX.
